[Audio:title-tune:Title Tune]
Played by #R$A1B2 while the title menu is shown, until a key is pressed.
The music data is at #R$5FC3.

#AUDIO0(title-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(TitleTune))

[Audio:start-tune:Start Tune]
Played by #R$A1C1 when the game is started from the title menu (see #R$60E8).
The music data is at #R$6048.

#AUDIO0(start-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(StartTune))

[Audio:game-over-tune:Game Over Tune]
Played by #R$A1C1 when a player has no lives left (see #R$DE9D).
The music data is at #R$DFD1.

#AUDIO0(game-over-tune.wav)(#INCLUDE(GameOverTune))

[Audio:fanfare:Fanfare]
Played by #R$9EA3, which is called by #R$DFF0.
The music data is at #R$9EBF.

#AUDIO0(fanfare.wav)(#INCLUDE(Fanfare))

[Audio:rising-sweep:Rising Sweep]
Played by #R$9EB7 when the player collects an item that gives an extra life (see
#R$D5DF).

#AUDIO0(rising-sweep.wav)(#INCLUDE(RisingSweep))

[Audio:buzz:Buzz]
Played by #R$9ED1. The routine is not called by the game, but the other buzzes
use the same code (see #R$9ED1(#N$9ED5)).

#AUDIO0(buzz.wav)(#INCLUDE(Buzz))

[Audio:short-buzz:Short Buzz]
Played by #R$9EE3 when a type #N$05 entity is created (see #R$A630).

#AUDIO0(short-buzz.wav)(#INCLUDE(ShortBuzz))

[Audio:tiny-buzz:Tiny Buzz]
Played by #R$9EEA on every frame that a type #N$0D entity exists (see #R$9DC0).

#AUDIO0(tiny-buzz.wav)(#INCLUDE(TinyBuzz))

[Audio:buzz-sweep:Buzz Sweep]
Played by #R$9EF1 when a bottle is collected (see #R$A3FE).

#AUDIO0(buzz-sweep.wav)(#INCLUDE(BuzzSweep))

[Audio:random-noise:Random Noise]
Played by #R$9F06 when a type #N$07 entity is made (see #R$9924).

#AUDIO0(random-noise.wav)(#INCLUDE(RandomNoise))

[Audio:long-buzz:Long Buzz]
Played by #R$9F2A while an entity is following its path (see #R$D202).

#AUDIO0(long-buzz.wav)(#INCLUDE(LongBuzz))

[Audio:falling-sweep:Falling Sweep]
Played by #R$9F31 while an entity is following its path (see #R$D202).

#AUDIO0(falling-sweep.wav)(#INCLUDE(FallingSweep))

[Audio:short-rising-sweep:Short Rising Sweep]
Played by #R$9F40 (see #R$CD11).

#AUDIO0(short-rising-sweep.wav)(#INCLUDE(ShortRisingSweep))

[Audio:medium-buzz:Medium Buzz]
Played by #R$9F4E when an extra record is updated (see #R$B7CE).

#AUDIO0(medium-buzz.wav)(#INCLUDE(MediumBuzz))

[Audio:slow-fall:Slow Fall]
Played by #R$9F55 when entities of the types #N$08 and #N$0F change (see
#R$9AD9 and #R$9A0A).

#AUDIO0(slow-fall.wav)(#INCLUDE(SlowFall))

[Audio:brief-buzz:Brief Buzz]
Played by #R$9F68 when a type #N$0E entity is created (see #R$9820).

#AUDIO0(brief-buzz.wav)(#INCLUDE(BriefBuzz))

[Audio:shot-sound:Shot Sound]
Played by #R$9F6F when an entity of the type #N$09 fires (see #R$9CBA).

#AUDIO0(shot-sound.wav)(#INCLUDE(ShotSound))

[Audio:entity-sound:Entity Sound]
Played by #R$9ABE when a type #N$08 entity is updated while its frame number
is below #N$05 (see #R$9AD9). The recording is three plays of the sound, one
frame apart, with field #N$20 of the entity set to #N$00, #N$0F and #N$1F.

#AUDIO0(entity-sound.wav)(#INCLUDE(EntitySound))
